{"parse": {"title": "TNV-06", "pageid": 28142, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/TNV-05\" title=\"TNV-05\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">TNV-06</span><a href=\"/wiki/TNV-07\" title=\"TNV-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">TNV</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">06</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E4.B9.A6.E4.BF.A1.E6.9C.AB.E7.AB.AF\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"书信末端\">书信末端</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 书信末端</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">So Concludeth the Epistle</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>追<span class=\"color-value\"></span>逐<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>追<span class=\"color-value\"></span>逐<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>直<span class=\"color-value\"></span>到<span class=\"color-value\"></span>路<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>尽<span class=\"color-value\"></span>头<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>也<span class=\"color-value\"></span>被<span class=\"color-value\"></span>抛<span class=\"color-value\"></span>在<span class=\"color-value\"></span>身<span class=\"color-value\"></span>后<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 190706</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun\"><img alt=\"1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png/600px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png/900px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png/1200px-Cg-1_6_bg_caoyuan_chun.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“罗兰”：</div><div>“哈哈哈，邪恶的巨人，可惜你今天遇到了罗兰。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“罗兰”：</div><div>“算你倒了大霉！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“罗兰”：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“罗兰”：</div><div>未锈铠先生，这真的是罗兰骑士的台词吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“旁白”：</div><div>咳咳……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“旁白”：</div><div>某人说过了，那时候的他，还是一个年轻气盛的小伙子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“旁白”：</div><div>总之，经过了漫长的跋涉，他们见到了菲尔格特。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“旁白”：</div><div>如同书信中所说的那样，菲尔格特拥有着15英尺的身高，裸露的皮肤上生满了癞疮与脓包。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“罗兰”：</div><div>“我先上！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“旁白”：</div><div>罗兰骑士用双腿一夹马腹，朝菲尔格特冲了过去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“罗兰”：</div><div>可是我们现在没有马。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“旁白”：</div><div>嗯……您说的对。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“旁白”：</div><div>也许某人应该去征求哒哒达利先生的意见，也许它会愿意加入我们的剧目。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“旁白”：</div><div>总之，“罗兰”先生，现在请您假装自己骑着一匹马。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“旁白”：</div><div>然后说出接下来的台词。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“罗兰”：</div><div>“卑劣的巨人，今天我就会战胜你。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“旁白”：</div><div>罗兰骑士一边冲刺，一边这样说着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“旁白”：</div><div>他高高地举起了手中的恒常之剑，向巨人的脚踝砍了下去——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“旁白”：</div><div>剑锋与脚踝相撞，就像是两块金属撞击，甚至还迸溅出了金色的火花。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“旁白”：</div><div>这一剑没有伤害到巨人，反而彻底地激怒了他。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“旁白”：</div><div>他伸手一挥，从马背上抓起了罗兰骑士，并将他高高举起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“旁白”：</div><div>战马受到了惊吓，沿着远方跑去，再也找不到踪迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“旁白”：</div><div>战况胶着，奥德骑士拧紧了眉毛，拔出长剑，也冲了上去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"303911.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-303911.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-303911.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"303911.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-303911.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-303911.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5a/HeadIconSmall-303911.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-303911.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“奥德”：</div><div>“呀——”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“旁白”：</div><div>她从马背上高高跃起，将长剑横劈在菲尔格特的肚子上。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“旁白”：</div><div>同样的金色火花。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“旁白”：</div><div>但巨人却发出了痛苦的嘶鸣。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“罗兰”：</div><div>“肚脐眼，肚脐眼——”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“旁白”：</div><div>罗兰骑士像是发现了什么东西，大声喊道。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“旁白”：</div><div>奥德听到那声音，回头望向菲尔格特。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“旁白”：</div><div>只见菲尔格特的肚皮上毫发无伤，只有肚脐眼上有一条淡淡的血痕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"303913.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-303913.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-303913.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"303913.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-303913.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-303913.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/71/HeadIconSmall-303913.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-303913.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“奥德”：</div><div>“原来他的弱点，在肚脐眼！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“旁白”：</div><div>奥德骑士这样想着，内心顿时充满了希望。她再次举起了长剑——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“旁白”：</div><div>而菲尔格特此时到达了愤怒的极点，他的手指开始收紧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“旁白”：</div><div>罗兰骑士发出了不堪重负的惨叫！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“罗兰”：</div><div>“啊——”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“旁白”：</div><div>幸运的是，在千钧一发之际，奥德手中的剑刺入了巨人的肚脐！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“旁白”：</div><div>菲尔格特颤抖着倒下了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“旁白”：</div><div>他的手指紧紧合拢，指节上有着隐约的血迹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“旁白”：</div><div>奥德拔出了插在巨人肚脐中的剑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“旁白”：</div><div>他们就这样赢下了与巨人的对决。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-300710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-300710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-300710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>APPLe先生，故事结束了，某人认为现在可以不需要灯光了。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi1\"><img alt=\"1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/Cg-1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi1.png/600px-Cg-1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/Cg-1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi1.png/900px-Cg-1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/Cg-1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi1.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_at_weixiukaiyishi1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_at_ys_weixiukaiyishi1.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_at_ys_weixiukaiyishi1\"><img alt=\"1_7_at_ys_weixiukaiyishi1\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/Cg-1_7_at_ys_weixiukaiyishi1.png/600px-Cg-1_7_at_ys_weixiukaiyishi1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/Cg-1_7_at_ys_weixiukaiyishi1.png/900px-Cg-1_7_at_ys_weixiukaiyishi1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/76/Cg-1_7_at_ys_weixiukaiyishi1.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_at_ys_weixiukaiyishi1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>室内的灯光渐渐地暗了下来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-300710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-300710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-300710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>这个故事如何？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">雾行者：</div><div>未锈铠先生，奥德骑士战胜了巨人，她应该带着功绩回去受封，成为一名真正的骑士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">雾行者：</div><div>你遗漏了这一点——而这才是观众们最爱看的情节。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"303912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-303912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-303912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"303912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-303912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-303912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/85/HeadIconSmall-303912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-303912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">泥鯭的士：</div><div>还有噶，这个皇帝好孤寒哦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"303901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-303901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-303901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"303901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-303901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-303901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/34/HeadIconSmall-303901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-303901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">泥鯭的士：</div><div>我要是皇帝，一定会给她好鬼多赏赐，像什么地啦，钱啦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"303914.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-303914.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-303914.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"303914.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-303914.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-303914.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-303914.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-303914.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">泥鯭的士：</div><div>她有了地和钱，就可以回去起屋了——屋子可是好东西哦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300711.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-300711.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300711.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300711.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-300711.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300711.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-300711.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300711.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>事实上，奥德女士最终没有被授封为骑士，她在战胜了巨人之后，便离开了布列塔尼，去追寻她一直向往的自由。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300711.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-300711.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300711.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300711.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-300711.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300711.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-300711.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300711.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>她在战胜了巨人之后，在四方游历。遇到有趣的事，她就会将它写下来，告知某人和奥利弗。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300711.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-300711.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300711.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300711.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-300711.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300711.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-300711.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300711.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>她在决斗中赢下了一座城堡，随后将里面的宝藏分发给了当地的农民，一时被传为佳话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300711.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-300711.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300711.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300711.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-300711.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300711.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/48/HeadIconSmall-300711.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300711.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>再后来，她结识了一位伯格音女士，她们志趣相投，变成了无话不谈的密友。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-300710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-300710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-300710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>——当然，她的信件也为某人提供了很多笑话的灵感。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-300710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-300710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-300710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>不知道奥德女士是否满意这个结局。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-300710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-300710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-300710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>某人现在所讲述的，是一个近乎真实的故事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300710.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-300710.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300710.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300710.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-300710.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300710.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-300710.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300710.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">未锈铠：</div><div>虽然，为了讲述上的方便，某人对部分情节作了轻微的修改。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>嘘——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>观众们显然对这个结局并不满意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"301801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"301801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/68/HeadIconSmall-301801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-301801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">雾行者：</div><div>我认为，故事中还是应该加上受封仪式——奥德完全可以在成为骑士之后，再去四方游历。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"303914.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-303914.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-303914.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"303914.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-303914.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-303914.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/72/HeadIconSmall-303914.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-303914.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">泥鯭的士：</div><div>还有！皇帝也要给她很多很多的赏赐！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TNV-06"}}